WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:12.239
"I'm tall."

2
00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:16.370
"I'm taller than you."

3
00:00:16.371 --> 00:00:18.313
"But I'm the tallest.

4
00:00:18.314 --> 00:00:21.625
I'm the best!"

5
00:00:21.626 --> 00:00:24.552
"But I'm pretty."

6
00:00:24.553 --> 00:00:28.074
"I'm prettier than you."

7
00:00:28.075 --> 00:00:29.816
"I'm the prettiest.

8
00:00:29.817 --> 00:00:33.593
I'm the best!"

9
00:00:33.594 --> 00:00:36.300
"I'm yellow."

10
00:00:36.301 --> 00:00:39.008
"I'm green."

11
00:00:39.009 --> 00:00:41.223
"I'm yellow and green.

12
00:00:41.224 --> 00:00:50.152
I'm the best!"

13
00:00:50.153 --> 00:00:54.063
"Ha-ha! Now I can't hear the sunflower."

14
00:00:54.064 --> 00:00:57.541
"I can't hear her either!"

15
00:00:57.542 --> 00:01:00.486
"She made me feel bad."

16
00:01:00.487 --> 00:01:03.905
"I felt worse!"

17
00:01:03.906 --> 00:01:06.494
"I'm sorry."

18
00:01:06.495 --> 00:01:09.625
"That's okay."

19
00:01:09.626 --> 00:01:14.346
"By the way, you taste sweeter than me."

20
00:01:14.347 --> 00:01:18.095
"Thank you. You taste cooler than me."

21
00:01:18.096 --> 00:01:23.858
"Thanks. Hey! Let's be friends."

22
00:01:23.859 --> 00:01:29.309
"What a good idea!"
